{"id":"n24547-1-7","stage":3,"title":"붙들다 · 抓住","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24547-1-7-1","ko":"너 왜 전화기를 그렇게 붙들고 있어?","zh":"你为什么那样紧紧握着电话啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"전화기를","meaning":"电话机","explanation":"전화기：电话机；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"전화기","audio":"/audio/920d2edb729250383ea3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70846","senseId":"1","lemma":"전화기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전화기를","audio":"/audio/0fa5e90bf0e57d44b5d8.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"붙들고","meaning":"抓住，揪住","explanation":"붙들다：抓住，揪住；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"붙들다","audio":"/audio/1a606eeac098fedc4062.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24547","senseId":"1","lemma":"붙들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붙들고","audio":"/audio/b535fe4dd4784ec29844.mp3"}},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"920d2edb72925038","term":"전화기","zh":"电话机","audio":"/audio/920d2edb729250383ea3.mp3","entryId":"70846","definition":"把说话声变成电波或电流发送出去，使相隔很远的人也可以互相对话的机器。","pronunciation":["전ː화기"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"1a606eeac098fedc","term":"붙들다","zh":"抓住，揪住","audio":"/audio/1a606eeac098fedc4062.mp3","entryId":"24547","definition":"攥住某物以防止掉落或错过。","pronunciation":["붇뜰다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b5105e0d238b836720ae.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24547-1-7-2","ko":"연락 올 곳이 있어서 계속 기다리고 있어.","zh":"因为有地方会联系我，所以一直在等。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"연락","meaning":"联络，联系","explanation":"연락：联络，联系","readings":[{"term":"연락","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14013","senseId":"1","lemma":"연락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연락","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3"}},{"text":"올","meaning":"来，传来","explanation":"오다：来，传来；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"6","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3"}},{"text":"곳이","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳이","audio":"/audio/425fee6379fd1e4146b7.mp3"}},{"text":"있어서","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어서","audio":"/audio/8c518243ad11245b602e.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"기다리고","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기다리고","audio":"/audio/3fa491e3478acc334518.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b1c3b94a6a87c1f5","term":"연락","zh":"联络，联系","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3","entryId":"14013","definition":"传达告知某个事实。","pronunciation":["열락"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，传来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"消息或联系等被转达给某人。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407